{
  "_comment": "Shared parity cases for the profile editor's live readiness. Each input is the request body the editor sends (buildProfilePayload + the submit hook's signals); each expected block is profile_cli's output for it. Asserted by BOTH pipeline/jobfit/tests/test_profile_readiness_parity.py (profile_cli.main) and app/features/tools/profile/profileReadiness.test.ts (the TS port). An expected block is what profile_cli answers for its input: when a rule changes on purpose, take the new answer from the Python test's diff, never from the TS side.",
